OL,3,GNEWSAYork Central first phase approved
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe first phase of the York Central
OL,6,Fdevelopment has been granted detailed
OL,7,Fplanning approval, clearing the way for
OL,8,Fmore than 1,000 homes, a hotel, offices
OL,9,Fand a new entrance to York Railway
OL,10,FStation.
OL,12,FCity of York Council approved the plans
OL,13,Ffor the regeneration scheme on a
OL,14,F110-acre brownfield site behind the
OL,15,Fstation, one of the UK's largest city
OL,16,Fcentre development projects.
OL,18,FThe decision allows developers McLaren
OL,19,FRegeneration and Arlington Real Estate
OL,20,Fto begin work on the first stage of the
OL,21,F#2bn project, with construction
OL,22,Fexpected to start next year.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
