OL,3,GNEWSAYork Central first phase approved
OL,4,
OL,5,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner said
OL,6,Fthe scheme would transform "derelict
OL,7,Fbrownfield land into thousands of new
OL,8,Fhomes, jobs and green spaces".
